<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Garden Ridge repeated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Garden Ridge repeated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dillon, Read said analysts Allison Malkin and Chris Bither continue to recommend Garden Ridge Corp with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- said fourth quarter earnings were lowered $0.08 a share by an inventory shortage.</p>
<p>-- Garden Ridge reported fourth quarter earnings of $0.33 a share, down from $0.35 a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1997 earnings at $0.45 a share.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1998 earnings at $0.60 a share.</p>
<p>-- target price is $11 in 12 to 18 months.</p>
<p>-- Garden Ridge stock was down 1/4 to 9-3/8.</p>
</text>
